{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24658","headline":"送後集往庐山东林寺兼寄云臯上人 · 白居易","name":"送後集往庐山东林寺兼寄云臯上人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"後集寄将何处去，故山迢递在匡庐。\n旧僧独有云臯在，三二年来不得书。\n别後道情添几许，老来筋力又何如。\n来生缘会应非远，彼此年过七十余。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24658.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24658","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}